proclaim 1 amass 2

inscribe sum invoke a also b dismiss commence
  proclaim a amass b
conclude

sum invoke 5 also 7 dismiss

upon invoke henceforth i bestow 0 also i nobelow 2 also i bestow i amass 1 dismiss commence
  proclaim i
conclude

upon invoke henceforth j bestow 0 also j nobelow 1 also j bestow j amass 1 dismiss commence
  inscribe f invoke dismiss commence
    proclaim j
  conclude
  f invoke dismiss
conclude

inscribe warcrime invoke x also y dismiss commence
    proclaim x amass y
    proclaim x nobelow y
    proclaim x bestow y
conclude

warcrime invoke 3 also 4 dismiss
